    "Siri 短语是中文的；如果 Siri 设置为英文，可以在「快捷指令」App 里给这些操作起一个英文名字再用 Siri 调用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siri phrases follow the app language (Chinese or English). If Siri uses a different language, save these actions in the Shortcuts app under a name of your choice and say that name to Siri."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siri 短語是中文的；如果 Siri 設定為英文，可以在「捷徑」App 裡給這些操作起一個英文名字再用 Siri 呼叫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
