    "「%@」看起来是扫描件，已把页面转成图片%@。识别图片需要视觉模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” looks like a scanned document, so its pages were converted to images%@. Reading images requires a vision model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」看起來是掃描件，已把頁面轉成圖片%@。識別圖片需要視覺模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」里没有可以读取的内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” has no readable content."
