    "价格单位：美元 / 每百万 token。费用 = token 数 × 单价，仅供参考，实际以服务商账单为准。显示货币和汇率可在「设置 › 费用估算」中修改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prices are in US dollars per million tokens. Cost = tokens × price; for reference only, your provider’s bill is final. Change the display currency and exchange rate in “Settings › Cost estimate”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "價格單位：美元 / 每百萬 token。費用 = token 數 × 單價，僅供參考，實際以服務商賬單為準。顯示貨幣和匯率可在「設定 › 費用估算」中修改。"
