    "先概括整体内容，再按要点描述细节（人物、物体、文字、场景、动作）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start with an overall summary, then describe the details point by point (people, objects, text, setting, actions)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先概括整體內容，再按要點描述細節（人物、物體、文字、場景、動作）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先简要说明打算怎么做，完成后给出清晰的结论和来源链接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Briefly explain the plan first; when done, give a clear conclusion with source links."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先簡要說明打算怎麼做，完成後給出清晰的結論和來源連結。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先让学生自己尝试，再给提示；答案正确时真诚表扬；内容必须适合儿童。看到题目照片时，先确认题目内容再讲解。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let the student try first, then give hints; praise sincerely when the answer is right; all content must be suitable for children. When you see a photo of a question, confirm what it says before explaining."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先讓學生自己嘗試，再給提示；答案正確時真誠表揚；內容必須適合兒童。看到題目照片時，先確認題目內容再講解。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
