    "关闭时，只有最近一条带图片的消息会附带图片，之前的图片以文字占位，可以大幅减少请求体积和等待时间。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, only the most recent message with images includes them; earlier images are replaced by a text placeholder, which greatly reduces request size and waiting time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉時，只有最近一條帶圖片的訊息會附帶圖片，之前的圖片以文字佔位，可以大幅減少請求體積和等待時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
