    "占用 = 下一次请求大约要发送给模型的内容（人格设定、记忆、摘要、历史消息、正在输入的文字）。Ollama 的实际窗口取决于服务器设置，检测不到时请手动选择。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage = roughly what the next request will send to the model (persona, memory, summary, history and the text you’re typing). Ollama’s real window depends on the server settings; choose it manually if it can’t be detected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
