          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我可以帮你上网查资料、打开网页、填写表单。想让我做什么？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can look things up online, open web pages and fill in forms for you. What would you like me to do?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我可以幫你上網查資料、開啟網頁、填寫表單。想讓我做什麼？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所有数据仅保存在本机，不会上传到除你的服务器以外的任何地方。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All data is stored only on this device and is never uploaded anywhere except to your own servers."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有資料僅儲存在本機，不會上傳到除你的伺服器以外的任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
