          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到編號為 [%lld] 的元素。頁面可能已經變化，請先用 read_page 獲取最新編號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把 ${text} 发送给 ${agent}": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send ${text} to ${agent}"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把 ${text} 傳送給 ${agent}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把「文字」设为「快捷指令输入」；如果要分享图片，把「图片」也设为「快捷指令输入」。可以在「要求」里写「翻译成中文」「总结要点」等。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set “Text” to “Shortcut Input”; to share images, set “Images” to “Shortcut Input” too. You can put “Translate into English”, “Summarise the key points” and so on in “Instructions”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把「文字」設為「捷徑輸入」；如果要分享圖片，把「圖片」也設為「捷徑輸入」。可以在「要求」裡寫「翻譯成中文」「總結要點」等。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把文字或图片发送给 AI 助手处理，并打开 App 查看回复。配合快捷指令的「在共享表单中显示」，可以从 Safari 等 App 的分享菜单直接发送。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send text or images to your AI assistant and open the app to see the reply. With “Show in Share Sheet” turned on in Shortcuts, you can send straight from the Share menu in Safari and other apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把文字或圖片傳送給 AI 助手處理，並開啟 App 檢視回復。配合捷徑的「在分享表單中顯示」，可以從 Safari 等 App 的分享選單直接傳送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
