    "点击后": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On tap"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點選後"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击圆圈选择要记住的内容，也可以直接修改文字。记住的内容会出现在这个助手的记忆本里，之后的所有对话都会用到。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a circle to choose what to remember, or edit the text directly. Remembered items go into this assistant’s memory notebook and are used in all future conversations."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點選圓圈選擇要記住的內容，也可以直接修改文字。記住的內容會出現在這個助手的記憶本里，之後的所有對話都會用到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击选择 / 取消，长按查看大图。已选帧合计约 %@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap to select / deselect; long-press to enlarge. Selected frames total about %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點選選擇 / 取消，長按檢視大圖。已選幀合計約 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击页面上的元素（链接、按钮、复选框等），返回点击后的页面内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap an element on the page (link, button, checkbox, etc.) and return the page content afterwards."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點選頁面上的元素（連結、按鈕、核取方塊等），返回點選後的頁面內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点底部的 ⓘ（或快捷指令名称旁的设置），打开「在共享表单中显示」，输入类型选「文本」「图像」「URL」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap ⓘ at the bottom (or the settings next to the shortcut name), turn on “Show in Share Sheet”, and choose “Text”, “Images” and “URLs” as input types."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點底部的 ⓘ（或捷徑名稱旁的設定），開啟「在分享表單中顯示」，輸入型別選「文字」「影像」「URL」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
