            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成回覆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "生成回复或浏览器助手工作时，切到其他 App 或锁屏，可以在灵动岛和锁屏上看到进度、用时和当前步骤，点按回到对话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While a reply is being generated or the browser assistant is working, switch to another app or lock your phone to see progress, elapsed time and the current step in the Dynamic Island and on the Lock Screen. Tap to return to the conversation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成回覆或瀏覽器助手工作時，切到其他 App 或鎖定畫面，可以在動態島和鎖定畫面上看到進度、用時和當前步驟，點按回到對話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "生成回复时，切到其他 App 也能在灵动岛和锁屏上看到进度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While a reply is being generated, you can see its progress in the Dynamic Island and on the Lock Screen even from other apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成回覆時，切到其他 App 也能在動態島和鎖定畫面上看到進度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用 Apple Pencil 圈出想问的地方": {
