            "value": "用 Pencil 標註並提問"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用孩子能听懂的简单语言，多举生活中的例子。一步一步引导思考，而不是直接给出答案。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use simple language a child can understand, with lots of everyday examples. Guide their thinking step by step rather than giving the answer straight away."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用孩子能聽懂的簡單語言，多舉生活中的例子。一步一步引導思考，而不是直接給出答案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
