    "网络": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Network"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "網路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "网络不可用。请确认设备已连接到与服务器相同的 Wi-Fi，并在「设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 本地网络」中允许本应用访问。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The network is unavailable. Make sure this device is on the same Wi-Fi as the server, and allow this app in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "網路不可用。請確認裝置已連線到與伺服器相同的 Wi-Fi，並在「設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 本地網路」中允許本應用存取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "网络中断、服务器繁忙或超时时自动重新连接；如果已经生成了一部分，会从中断处接着写。全部重试失败后，可以在消息下方点「从断点继续」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reconnects automatically when the network drops, the server is busy or a request times out; if part of the reply was already received, it continues from where it stopped. If all retries fail, tap “Continue” under the message."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "網路中斷、伺服器繁忙或超時時自動重新連線；如果已經生成了一部分，會從中斷處接著寫。全部重試失敗後，可以在訊息下方點「從斷點繼續」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "置顶到上下文": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pin to context"
          }
        },
