    "请在整个对话中始终保持以上人格设定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always stay in the persona above throughout the conversation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請在整個對話中始終保持以上人格設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请开始说话…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start speaking…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請開始說話…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请把下面的对话内容压缩成一段简洁的摘要，供之后继续对话时参考。\n要求：保留关键事实、用户的需求和偏好、已经得出的结论或决定、尚未完成的事项；用第三人称叙述（「用户」「%@」）；不超过 400 字；只输出摘要本身。\n\n": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Condense the conversation below into a concise summary to refer to later in the conversation.\nRequirements: keep key facts, the user’s needs and preferences, conclusions or decisions reached, and unfinished items; write in the third person (“the user”, “%@”); no more than 250 words; output only the summary.\n\n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請把下面的對話內容壓縮成一段簡潔的摘要，供之後繼續對話時參考。\n要求：保留關鍵事實、使用者的需求和偏好、已經得出的結論或決定、尚未完成的事項；用第三人稱敘述（「使用者」「%@」）；不超過 400 字；只輸出摘要本身。\n\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请求次数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請求次數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请求超时。模型可能仍在加载，或者图片/视频帧太多，请稍后重试或减少附件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The request timed out. The model may still be loading, or there are too many images/video frames. Try again later or remove some attachments."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請求超時。模型可能仍在載入，或者圖片/影片幀太多，請稍後重試或減少附件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
