            "value": "For LM Studio, llama.cpp, vLLM, Ollama (/v1) and more. Example address: http://192.168.1.10:1234"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "適用於 LM Studio、llama.cpp、vLLM、Ollama（/v1）等。地址示例：http://192.168.1.10:1234"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "适用于会「思考」的推理模型，如 Qwen3、DeepSeek-R1、gpt-oss。「低 / 中 / 高」三档只对支持分级的模型（如 gpt-oss）有区别，其他模型选这三档都等同于「开启思考」。如果模型不支持思考，App 会自动去掉这个参数重新请求。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For reasoning models that “think”, such as Qwen3, DeepSeek-R1 and gpt-oss. Low / Medium / High only differ on models that support levels (such as gpt-oss); for other models all three just mean “thinking on”. If a model doesn’t support thinking, the app drops this setting and retries automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "適用於會「思考」的推理模型，如 Qwen3、DeepSeek-R1、gpt-oss。「低 / 中 / 高」三檔只對支援分級的模型（如 gpt-oss）有區別，其他模型選這三檔都等同於「開啟思考」。如果模型不支援思考，App 會自動去掉這個引數重新請求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
