        }
      }
    },
    "（回复长度达到上限，工具调用没有执行。可以在助手设置中调大「最大回复长度」。）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(The reply reached its length limit, so the tool calls were not run. You can increase “Max reply length” in the assistant settings.)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（回覆長度達到上限，工具呼叫沒有執行。可以在助手設定中調大「最大回復長度」。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "（对话开始时你已经对用户说过：「%@」）": {
